                        "entry_id": "1281d27e-a769-309d-84ff-cbe05aa17ce3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Gros amas de graisses alimentaires et autres déchets ménagers que l’on peut trouver dans les égouts."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "neologism"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b2c95264-e12c-41f3-9079-9275752bde6f",
                                "sense_id": "7ea74db7-12ec-3303-9789-3bfe51339fc9",
                                "text": "Ce fatberg, mot-valise issu de «fat» et «iceberg» (c'est-à-dire «montagne de graisse»), est bien plus conséquent que celui repéré en 2013 et qui pesait environ 15 tonnes."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "80c28548-0cb0-45f7-8bd1-126621b23584",
                        "source_entry_id": "1281d27e-a769-309d-84ff-cbe05aa17ce3",
                        "source_sense_id": "7ea74db7-12ec-3303-9789-3bfe51339fc9",
                        "target_lang_word": "fatberg",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "fatberg",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "672546d9-0ffd-30b3-b961-36deb796f2c7",
                                        "entry_id": "f994d159-5ff4-34bd-ab01-0fea003c1565",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A large accumulation of fat and discarded toiletries which clogs sewers."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "06d49b50-ee64-4941-a0f1-90c70f20d176",
                                                "sense_id": "672546d9-0ffd-30b3-b961-36deb796f2c7",
                                                "text": "Months ago a tunnel was clogged with a fatberg. It took a team of workers a month to move it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ffd653a5-090b-4d4f-94cb-0b63fca2f573",
                                                "sense_id": "672546d9-0ffd-30b3-b961-36deb796f2c7",
                                                "text": "Bleeding big fatberg up there. About half a ton's worth. [...] Gorman feels an involuntary shudder travel down his spine and agitate his stomach. He's seen those fatbergs on the training videos; huge accumulated walls of solidified grease and food and tissue and excrement, the churned result of everyday debris tipped down the domestic sinks and bathtubs and toilets of London."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b5e1e184-16fc-4310-8475-45276f3a05cc",
                                                "sense_id": "672546d9-0ffd-30b3-b961-36deb796f2c7",
                                                "text": "Then I worked in the sewers of Manchester – a six month stint of that, jabbing pressure-water-poles at fatbergs, tonnes of used kebab grease and congealed sump oil, woven together with thousands of used wet wipes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bb9c6eeb-082e-44f6-8fc2-15f4c857e92c",
                                                "sense_id": "672546d9-0ffd-30b3-b961-36deb796f2c7",
                                                "text": "A 250-metre long fatberg weighing 130 tonnes which was blocking an east London sewer has been cleared after a nine-week \"battle\". The solid mass of congealed fat, wet wipes, nappies, oil and condoms was found in the Victorian-era tunnel in Whitechapel in September. Thames Water said it had taken longer to clear than expected because of the damage it caused to the sewer."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "65204f2e-9126-4ba4-b905-53122886e608",
                                                "sense_id": "672546d9-0ffd-30b3-b961-36deb796f2c7",
                                                "text": "Thames Water has become the latest object lesson in the predictable and predicted folly of privatised monopolies, aided by a regulator that’s an even bigger wet wipe than the fatbergs bunging up the sewers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
